  "sparePlanCopy295": "Life does not always change through large blocks of free time. A small, protected period each day, repeated through useful actions, can gradually build skills that stay with you.",
  "sparePlanCopy296": "You already have enough room to invest some time in yourself. The key is not doing a lot at once, but continuing so each practice makes the next one easier.",
